# This allowlist applies only to .oss-scanner/Dockerfile, not other images.
# Admit source/build inputs, not arbitrary files under the selected directories.
**
!CMakeLists.txt
!CMakeLists.txt.build
!COPYING
!include/**/*.h
!src/**/*.c
!test/**/CMakeLists.txt
!test/**/*.c
!test/**/*.cpp
!test/**/*.h
!test/**/*.sh
!test/platform-smoke.c.in
!test/unix/Makefile.am.build
!examples/**/CMakeLists.txt
!examples/**/*.c
!examples/**/*.h
!.oss-scanner/threat_model.md
# Reject VCS metadata and environment files even when names resemble source.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.env*
